s 1085->1141 occurs in (30000, 40000] (present in [21277,40000] step_08, absent in [21277,30000] step_12, absent in [39400,40000] step_10) while 1141->639 occurs only after 50000 (absent in [21277,40000] step_09, absent in [40000,40600] step_11, absent in [40000,50000] step_13, and the edge appears in the [50000,59677] neighbourhood step_16). The relay gap is therefore >10000 time units, more than 16x the 600-unit latency budget. Activity-volume confounders were checked: 1085's events are concentrated late (0 before 30000, 12 after 50000) whereas 639's are concentrated early (12 before 30000, only 3 after 50000) (step_14, step_15) \u2014 the two nodes' activity is anti-phased, so the apparent connection is driven by overall volume and hub popularity (1141/28 are high-degree hubs, step_03, step_16) rather than by any forward-in-time influence path.", "confidence": 0.78, "evidence": [{"trace_id": "step_02", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_06", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_07", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_08", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_09", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_10", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_11", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_12", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_13", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_01", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_03", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_04", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_05", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_14", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_15", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_16", "role": "confounder_control"}]}, "raw_final_response": "```json\n{\n  \"task_id\": \"t_cbc77a70\",\n  \"decision\": \"absent\",\n  \"mechanism\": \"cascade\",\n  \"entities\": [1085, 639, 1141],\n  \"window\": [21277, 59677],\n  \"narrative\": \"Static connectivity exists but is not time-respecting. 1085 has 24 events / 24 distinct partners and 639 has 